	(text "NOTE: \nIS31FL373Ω is powered from the +5V rail to allow for higher\nvoltage LEDs. The I2C bus operates natively at 3.3V. This\nlogic mismatch is validated. The minimum High-Level Input\nVoltage V{IH} of 1.4V. The 3.3V logic exceeds this threshold.\nA level shifter is intentionally omitted."
